<title>USA: Acres Gaming wins 3 orders.</title>
<headline>Acres Gaming wins 3 orders.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acres Gaming Inc said Thursday it has received three orders for slot machine displays and systems.</p>
<p>Acres said Australian company Crown Ltd ordered US$1.2 million worth of its displays to be used with progressive jackpot and bonus promotions at a new casino in Melbourne.</p>
<p>The order includes Acres' new curved &quot;Odometer&quot; displays and is scheduled for delivery in December 1996.</p>
<p>Acres said it received two new orders for its &quot;Hurricane Zone&quot; slot system, one from Circus Circus Enterprises Inc's Circus Circus Hotel &amp; Casino in Las Vegas and the other by Crystal Palace in the Bahamas.</p>
<p>The systems will be delivered before of 1996, Acres said. Financial details of these orders were not disclosed.</p>
